    {
      "id": "claim_cc87e787e08b47b3864b493f939c9c57",
      "statement": "Failed owner forwards are classified NotOwner, NeverConnected, or Ambiguous by the shell and retried by the core's Dispatcher at most once per class, never for Ambiguous, protecting at-most-once cell execution.",
