    {
      "id": "claim_cd0d464e891c4a6594fc229814e16cd5",
      "statement": "A cell at its concurrent-fetch ceiling (CELLD_MAX_CELL_REQUESTS, default 64) answers 503 with Retry-After: 1 and X-Celld-Overload: cell without starting the excess event, for direct requests and Queue producer admission alike.",
