      "id": "claim_a5870f4f3eb949f49c1f21271063ef5d",
      "statement": "Ingress WebSockets are independent tasks in three shapes (local, proxied to the owner, outbound-dialed); hibernation auto-responses are answered in the shell without routing or waking, and celld serves and dials with the same fastwebsockets implementation while hand-rolling the client handshake to preserve non-101 response bodies.",
