      "statement": "The workspace pins fastwebsockets exactly at =0.8.1 with unstable-split because WebSocket reads are not cancel-safe and the split halves let a live read survive while the same socket is written; an outbound DO WebSocket keeps its cell resident and closes if the cell moves.",
